<!-- Code Block -->
<div class="code-block">
  <div class="code-block__header">
    <span>Berechnungsbeispiel</span>
    <button class="code-block__copy">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
      Kopieren
    </button>
  </div>
  <pre>Nettoeinkommen:        3.000 €/Monat
Empfohlene BU-Rente:   2.100 €/Monat (70%)
Maximale BU-Rente:     2.400 €/Monat (80%)

Beispielrechnung (30 Jahre, Bürokaufmann):
Monatlicher Beitrag:   ca. 85-110 €</pre>
</div>

<style>
  /* Code Block */
  .code-block {
    margin: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .code-block__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    background: #2a2a2a;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }
  .code-block__copy {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }
  .code-block__copy:hover { color: var(--color-white); }
  .code-block pre {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    color: #e5e5e5;
  }
</style>
